{"id":"00260","root":"uni00260_1","name":{"ja":"ティナ・ウォーレル","en":"Tina Worrell"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"ティナ・ウォーレル","en":"Tina Worrell"},"element":"Science","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2019-10-31","limited":false,"characterId":190,"profile":{"ja":"米連の軍に所属するプラズマライフル使い。遊撃手として、特定の部隊には入らずに活動している。かつては実弾小銃歩兵部隊に所属し、大勢の仲間と共に戦う一兵士だったが、とある作戦で戦友を失い、自身も四肢を奪われた。その後四肢に取り付けられたアンドロイドアーム＆レッグは彼女自身の筋肉の運動によって発電する機能を備え、生み出された電力はプラズマライフルの電子弾としても使われる。それからは電子武装兵へと転身し、誰とも組むこともなくプラズマライフルを相棒として孤独に戦場を渡り歩いている。あえて他人とは距離を取ろうと冷たく振る舞っているが、根は優しい性格で、こっそりと人助けをすることもあり、内心で彼女を慕う者は多い。また、危険な任務を好んで受けたがり、強引に他部隊の任務を引き受けて死地に赴くこともある。その姿に、「死に場所を求めているのでは」や「自分のように仲間を失う兵を生みたくないのでは」など、様々な憶測が飛び交っているが、自身は何も語らず、本心は謎のままである。","en":"A plasma-rifle specialist serving in the United States military. As a guerrilla operative, she works independently of any specific unit. She once served in a conventional rifle infantry squad, fighting alongside many comrades, but lost her limbs during a mission. Prosthetic android arms and legs were attached to her, powered by the movement of her own muscles; the generated electricity fuels the plasma rifle's electron rounds. Since then she has become an electronic-weapon soldier, roaming the battlefield alone with her plasma rifle as a partner. She deliberately keeps a cold demeanor to maintain distance, yet she is fundamentally kind and occasionally helps people in secret, earning quiet admiration from many. She also seeks out dangerous missions, often hijacking tasks from other units and charging into lethal zones. Rumors swirl about her—some say she's \"looking for a place to die,\" others claim she \"doesn't want to create soldiers who lose comrades like herself\"—but she never speaks, keeping her true thoughts a mystery."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"藤吉ローズ","forms":[{"id":"uni00260_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[824,1648],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[107,214],"def":[97,194],"spd":[65,65],"luck":[1,80]},"spCh